{"resourceIdentifier":"1147","resourceName":"Amazon Rio IFM","description":"The Amazon Rio Project consists of a mosaic of four private areas (20,387 ha) in the Manicoré Municipality, state of Amazonas, Brazil, that will be conserved by Improved Forest Management (IFM). The project activity is based on the cancelation of a legally authorized logging plan that had been operational since 1999, added to the implementation of a Management Plan focused on emission reductions, biodiversity conservation, monitoring and sustainable social development in the region, including the promotion of eco-tourism, bioeconomy, and scientific research. With the purpose of improving the livelihoods of these communities, strengthening their organizational capacity, and promoting long-term conservation and sustainability, the project will benefits more than 500 families living in 15 communities surrounding the project area through several socio-economic programs focused on improving access to health, education, infrastructure, and income generation,.”","location":{"latitude":-5.996664,"longitude":-61.557634},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-04-23","endExclusive":"2025-05-24","endInclusive":"2025-05-23"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1147"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Amazonas State"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Empresa Brasileira de Conservacao de Florestas(EBCF)"},{"type":"string","value":"Paraná, Brazil"},{"type":"string","value":"+55 41 99922 6776"},{"type":"string","value":"eduardo@amagroup.com.br"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1147"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"1147"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"str